# Raised, rounded glass on Instagram phones

Status: DONE
Milestone: M61 Convex glass edges and device depth
Dependencies: 65_INSTAGRAM_BACKGROUND_COLOURS.todo

## Purpose

The owner says the phone screen looks flat and asks for bulged edges.
Give the two Instagram phone mockups rounded raised glass and side depth.

