## Acceptance criteria

- Curved raised edges, not a single flat rectangular outline.
- No screenshot corner mask, lens distortion, painted reflection over copy or lost content.
- Phone-only scope with no website, local cream or public release changes.
- No automatic Instagram posting or claim of visual approval.

